        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "retiam/rough is an adapter around RoughJS. RoughModifier converts RoughJS drawing commands into the engine’s contour system; RoughShape and roughify add higher-level styling and reveal helpers. roughjs is a required production dependency installed automatically with Retiam. Choose core Excalidraw for its native engine integration, or the rough library when RoughJS-specific output is required."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Excalidraw](/api-style-excalidraw#excalidraw), [ExcalidrawOptions](/api-style-excalidraw#excalidrawtypes), [ExcalidrawModifier](/api-modifiers-path#excalidrawmodifier), [RoughModifier](/api-libs-rough#roughmodifier), [RoughShape](/api-libs-rough#roughshape)."
        }
